= First local cubic graph-IC pilot
15 November 2026 · Public known-answer instance · Producer-run local observations

The user authorized local execution. Source
`3188372cc` ran on one pinned CPU with an 8-GiB virtual-memory ceiling and a
900-second whole-process limit. The process exited zero after 17.261 seconds.
The instance has p = 67, subgroup order 300193, seed 3. All 150 planned
executions were retained: 25 warmup and 125 measured executions. Five paired
rounds per oracle passed replay, input-fingerprint and local A/A controls.
These observations have no independent signed verdict. [pcc:unverified]

