All five methods recovered the target scalar. The best graph variant in this
pilot takes 25.61 times rho's wall time. The pivot version of that oracle
takes 27.81 times rho. This small, single-curve pilot does not establish a
large-subgroup crossover. The reference is the existing cubic r-adding code;
fastest external reference coverage remains open. [pcc:unverified]

